Quoting  Janis Papanagnou  <Janis_Papanagnou@hotmail.com>:
>Mike Kelly wrote:
>>Floating eye corpses always confer telepathy. Mind flayer corpses have
>>a 50% chance to give you 1+Int, otherwise they confer telepathy.
>I cannot find the "telepathy" part in the source code.
>Do you mean the "see invisible" intrinsic?

No - that's M1_SEE_INVIS, a monster property. Not all eating intrinsics
are listed in the second MR_ section in monst.c - in particular monsters
grant teleport and teleport control iff they have it (see
intrinsic_possible() in eat.c) and likewise telepathy, where the set of
telepathic monsters is not determined by M1_ properties in monst.c at all
but is hardcoded in include/mondata.h.
